; blocks.nc - the routed dialect: stage blocks go to CPU-A, galvo blocks to CPU-C
;
;   M610  stage block  -> grblHAL.  X Y Z A B are the gantry, mm, work coords.
;   M611  galvo block  -> CPU-C.    X Y are the scan field, mm, 0..250.
;   M600  layer break  -> recoat between layers.
;
; Stage moves here are small and inside the inherited soft limits
; (X 0..143, Y -145..0), so this runs without touching those settings.
G21
G90
; ================= layer 1 =================
M610                      ; --- stage: position the optics
G0 X20.00 Y-10.00
M611                      ; --- galvo: scan this layer
F1200000
